# === Security: never add new exports, backups, secrets or user uploads ===
# Existing tracked legacy dumps/uploads intentionally remain until the incident
# response plan is completed; ignore rules do not remove or alter them.
*.sql
*.dump
*.backup
*.sql.gz
*.dump.gz
*.tar.gz
backups/
restore-check/
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
static/uploads/**
